Wiki comparison composite for [[Het Nkik]], assembled from four Players Committee card-image renditions. Component sources, from left to right:

# '''Unmarked gallery face:''' [https://web.archive.org/web/20071218115237id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/anewhope/ls/hethkik.gif original PC gallery GIF], obtained from that exact 18 December 2007 replay (historical filename <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">hethkik.gif</code>). [[:File:ANH-L-hetnkik-PC-gallery-20071218115237.gif|Wiki source details]]; [[Media:ANH-L-hetnkik-PC-gallery-20071218115237.gif|unchanged recovered GIF]].
# '''2017 partial:''' [https://res.starwarsccg.org/virtual/DErrata.pdf#page=18 Official PC Decipher Errata sheet], official text as of 1 June 2017, PDF page 18, Het Nkik panel at the top of the right column. [[:File:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf|Full-document details]]; [[Media:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf|download the complete PDF]]. The actual composed PDF panel was rendered and cropped, retaining its overlaid text and symbols: [[:File:ANH-L-hetnkik-PC-June-2017-composed.png|panel details]]; [[Media:ANH-L-hetnkik-PC-June-2017-composed.png|source panel]].
# '''Full E face:''' [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/022435b7929e4de26dafbcb1de2ec1d6d04d2153/Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/large/hetnkik.gif exact Holotable-distributed GIF], repository copy present by 8 July 2018, repository path <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/large/hetnkik.gif</code>. [[:File:ANH-L-hetnkik-holotable-by-2018-07-08.gif|Wiki source details]]; [[Media:ANH-L-hetnkik-holotable-by-2018-07-08.gif|unchanged source GIF]].
# '''D-E1 face:''' [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/48d57c17d760f4bb25b4d55459f709eef5f8cb82/Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/hires/hetnkik.png exact Holotable-distributed PNG], repository copy of 27 January 2024, repository path <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/hires/hetnkik.png</code>. [[:File:ANH-L-hetnkik-holotable-2024-01-27.png|Wiki source details]]; [[Media:ANH-L-hetnkik-holotable-2024-01-27.png|unchanged source PNG]].

Acquisition: gallery bytes came from the exact archived replay; the partial was rendered from the complete official PDF; the marked full faces came from byte-matched cached Holotable images. SWCCG Wiki assembled the composite, adding labels and a white 1800×1100 canvas. The gallery and full E images remain at native size; the partial and D-E1 face were proportionally reduced to fit 440×1030 panel bounds, without retouching printed content. The component renditions are credited to the Players Committee; the original Lucasfilm/Decipher copyright remains visible. Capture, document and repository dates identify source occurrences; original publication days remain unestablished.